Input data to generate ExtDataFigure_7 PanelA are in folder:
/ExtDataFigure_7/Raw_data
containing ESC_WT (Rep1, Rep2) and NPC_WT (Rep1, Rep2).
 

Input data to generate ExtDataFigure_7 PanelB, PanelC, PanelD, and PanelF are thes ones used in Figure 4.
They are stored in folders:

/Figure_4/Raw_data
containing NPC_wt (rep1, rep3) and NPC_dA (rep1, rep2, rep3)
and
/Figure_4/Aligned_data/ 
containing NPC_WT_AfterAPC and NPC_dA_AfterAPC (after Procruste Analysis)
